Galzu is a tengu of [[Geography/Austrene/index|Austrene]], the sister of [[People/Anzu|Anzu]] and one of three children of [[People/Adal|Adal]]. She worked alongside her grandmother, and was the most driven of the three.

She spent months talking with the [[Org/Singers of the Herald's Star|Singers of the Herald's Star]] in [[Org/Belvedere|Belvedere]]. She argued with her father and stormed out of the roost, and has not been seen since. Her disappearance came at the same time as a break-in at a Belvedere archival facility. Adal searched her room afterward and found nothing out of place but the group she had fallen in with, and he could not find her anywhere in the city.
